# Obsidian Callouts

Converts blockquotes beginning with Obsidian callout markers such as `[!note]`, `[!warning]+`, or `[!tip]-` into scoped callout HTML during Pandoc Markdown conversion.

Callouts require this plugin to be enabled and apply only to `.md`, `.markdown`, `.txt`, and `.text` sources handled by the Markdown converter. The marker/title line can be separated from its body with a normal newline; trailing spaces are not required. Nested callouts receive no special handling beyond Pandoc's normal AST traversal and are not guaranteed to produce a particular nested structure.
